# Start octo with a test hook that sends a Ctrl-C right before the M code of a query runs
# Run [insert into names values (6, 'New', 'Name');]
PASS : Ctrl-C before the M code runs cancels the query
# Run [update names set firstname = 'Changed';]
PASS : Ctrl-C before the M code runs cancels the query
# Run [delete from names;]
PASS : Ctrl-C before the M code runs cancels the query
# Run [select * from names;]
PASS : Ctrl-C before the M code runs cancels the query
# Exit octo
# Start octo without the test hook
# Run [select * from names;]
PASS : The canceled INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE did not change the names table
# Exit octo
